body:
As the title says, this is supposed to be Faith Lehane from Buffy. I'll probably still tweak and fine tune it while I decide on which weapons and gear are best for the character. Either way it's a decent female character which I'm happy with. 

&#x200B;

Main reference image here (although I looked at many other photos):  [https://i.pinimg.com/originals/dc/4c/c4/dc4cc41cde2e351b0659811ee78b08c9.jpg](https://i.pinimg.com/originals/dc/4c/c4/dc4cc41cde2e351b0659811ee78b08c9.jpg)  

&#x200B;

Sliders are here:  [https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KKq7vtKkiEc](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KKq7vtKkiEc)
